    "title": "Here's who'll be on 'SNL' when Season 52 starts next week - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dennis Romero ,\n2 hours ago “Saturday Night Live” added two new names to its cast for its 52nd season, while another cast member is moving on. Saidah Belo-Osagie and Grace Reiter will join the sketch comedy show as featured players when it resumes next weekend, “SNL” announced Wednesday. “Welcome to the cast!”... Read full article",
